{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How powerful will you be? Become the best monster looter in the world! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters. Get loot. Get stronger. Then what? Kill BIGGER monsters. Get EVEN MORE loot. Upgrade. Upgrade again. Keep looting. Keep growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/32ca2306c0ede26e658b12abbdcab805.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/32ca2306c0ede26e658b12abbdcab805.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/32ca2306c0ede26e658b12abbdcab805.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Monsters and Loot Them!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into battle against hordes of monsters, each more dangerous (and more loot-filled) than the last.Smash, slash, and blast your way through enemies to collect precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger they are, the better the loot so don\u2019t stop now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/199a9e42fef10741da4a88b4bebfac9c.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/199a9e42fef10741da4a88b4bebfac9c.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/199a9e42fef10741da4a88b4bebfac9c.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dozens of Monsters to Loot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From slimy blobs to towering beasts, there's a whole zoo of monsters waiting to be looted. With dozens of enemy types, you\u2019ll always have something new to crush, farm\u2026 and plunder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/fbc90d46ad782cda1d5f85e125dcc8f0.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/fbc90d46ad782cda1d5f85e125dcc8f0.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/fbc90d46ad782cda1d5f85e125dcc8f0.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve Your Character!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your stats, unlock powerful bonuses, and become faster, stronger, and richer with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to be powerful to defeat the toughest monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/43b4e4156a69dfdb86ae4327e41ebc76.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/43b4e4156a69dfdb86ae4327e41ebc76.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/43b4e4156a69dfdb86ae4327e41ebc76.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Missions for Unique Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions to earn amazing loot like new equipment, unlockable content, and much more! Progress faster, grow stronger, and uncover everything Monster Looter has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/f3a9ae3d9c49edcfda8739c8d89f0e28.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/f3a9ae3d9c49edcfda8739c8d89f0e28.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/f3a9ae3d9c49edcfda8739c8d89f0e28.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Gear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful swords, shining armor, and epic upgrades! Enhance and optimize your gear to become the ultimate monster raider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/41e9b1e70566696dad3a2a03bd528716.poster.avif?t=1757433801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/41e9b1e70566696dad3a2a03bd528716.webm?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929990/extras/41e9b1e70566696dad3a2a03bd528716.mp4?t=1757433801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Rise Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the limit? Reset your progress through Ascension to unlock powerful permanent bonuses, rare upgrades, and brand-new content. Each run gets you closer to true greatness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it